%% Implemented backend proposal and driver response; no driver UI exists.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Centrale as RESPONSABILE
    participant API as MissionController
    participant Service as MissionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Autista as AUTISTA assegnato
    Centrale->>API: POST /missioni/{id}/proposte
    API->>Service: create proposal
    Service->>DB: lock mission/driver, check LIVE, availability
    Service->>DB: persist proposal, deadline, mission state
    DB-->>API: persisted proposal
    API-->>Centrale: deadline and proposal
    Autista->>API: POST /missioni/{id}/accept or /reject
    API->>Service: verify principal, current proposal, deadline
    Service->>DB: lock and persist outcome + event
    DB-->>API: committed outcome
    API-->>Autista: result
